OL,3,CNewcastle United captain signs for
OL,4,CArsenal
OL,6,FNewcastle United captain Bruno
OL,7,FGuimaraes has joined Arsenal.
OL,9,FThe 28-year-old has completed his long
OL,10,Fanticipated move to the Premier League
OL,11,Fchampions for an undisclosed fee, the
OL,12,FMagpies have confirmed.
OL,14,FHe joined the Tyneside club from Lyon
OL,15,Fin 2021 shortly after the Saudi-led
OL,16,Ftakeover and has scored more than 30
OL,17,Ftimes across nearly 200 matches under
OL,18,Fthe leadership of now-former manager
OL,19,FEddie Howe.
