OL,3,CNewcastle United captain signs for
OL,4,CArsenal
OL,6,FBruno was captain as Newcastle ended
OL,7,Ftheir 70-year-long wait for a major
OL,8,Ftrophy, leading the side as they were
OL,9,Fcrowned Carabao Cup champions in 2025.
OL,11,FHowever, the Brazilian midfielder had
OL,12,Fmade his wishes to move away from
OL,13,FNewcastle United clear and his move to
OL,14,Fthe Premier League title holders has
OL,15,Fbeen finalised.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
