OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1786439941
OL,3,CNewcastle United captain signs for
OL,4,CArsenal
OL,6,FAs his departure from St James' Park
OL,7,Fwas confirmed, Guimaraes said: "This
OL,8,Fis one of the toughest decisions of my
OL,9,Flife. When I arrived, the club was in
OL,10,Fa challenging position and I am
OL,11,Fincredibly proud of what we achieved
OL,12,Ftogether.
OL,14,F"I fell in love with this place. I
OL,15,Freally mean that. From my first day,
OL,16,Fthe supporters, my teammates, Eddie
OL,17,Fand the staff, and everyone connected
OL,18,Fwith the club made me and my family
OL,19,Ffeel at home.
OL,26,@oD@VtpvD@AOU
