CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1786439941
OL,3,CNewcastle United captain signs for
OL,4,CArsenal
OL,6,F"I thank PIF, our chairman Yasir Al-
OL,7,FRumayyan and Jamie Reuben for
OL,8,Feverything they have done for me and
OL,9,Ffor this football club. I also want to
OL,10,Fsay thank you to David and Ross for
OL,11,Fthe huge respect to me throughout this
OL,12,Fprocess. They did everything they
OL,13,Fcould to keep me at Newcastle, and I
OL,14,Fam very grateful for our time together.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
