PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1786439941
OL,3,CNewcastle United captain signs for
OL,4,CArsenal
OL,6,F"This move is very tough because
OL,7,FNewcastle means so much to me, but I
OL,8,Fwanted to experience something new in
OL,9,Fmy life. I feel ready for a new
OL,10,Fchallenge for myself and my family. I
OL,11,Fhad a very positive conversation with
OL,12,FMatthias Jaissle, and I leave knowing
OL,13,Fthe club is in very good hands.
OL,15,F"To the supporters, thank you will
OL,16,Fnever be enough, but I say it with all
OL,17,Fmy heart. I will always be proud to
OL,18,Fhave been part of this club's journey.
OL,19,FThank you for everything."
