OL,3,CNewcastle United captain signs for
OL,4,CArsenal
OL,6,FThe captain becomes the latest senior
OL,7,Fplayer to leave Tyneside this summer,
OL,8,Ffollowing the departures of Anthony
OL,9,FGordon and Sandro Tonali to Barcelona
OL,10,Fand Spurs respectively.
OL,12,FThere have been a number of summer
OL,13,Fsignings and Newcastle look to improve
OL,14,Fon their 12th place league finish last
OL,15,Fseason.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/6
